{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-22","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":22,"points":null,"unitId":"ecology","unitLabel":"진화·생태·행동","topic":"자연선택·진화","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["ecology","genetics"],"stem":"자연선택은생물의진화에있어서중요한요소이다. 자연선택의\n개념에대한<보기>의설명중옳은것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 자연선택에의한진화의방향은예측할수없다.\nㄴ. 자연선택은종의이득과는관계없이개체들에작용한다.\nㄷ. 자연선택은무작위적으로작용하지않으므로진화는일정\n한방향으로만진행된다.\nㄹ. 자연선택은이미존재하는형질(trait)에작용하므로새로\n운형질은생기지않는다.\nㅁ. 자연선택은표현형에작용하지만진화는집단의대립인자\n빈도의변화로일어난다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":401,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,49.06,308.8,160.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-22/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":7,"sourceRect":[82.744,151.34,416.5,412.712],"width":333.756,"height":261.372,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.056,49.06,308.8,160.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"22. 자연선택은생물의진화에있어서중요한요소이다. 자연선택의","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.035],"spans":[{"text":"22.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.985,11.035],"origin":[5.0,13.828],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"text":" 자연","bbox":[17.985,5.0,28.058,11.035],"origin":[17.985,13.828],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T10"},{"text":"선택","bbox":[45.516,5.0,20.426,11.035],"origin":[45.516,13.828],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T14"},{"text":"은생물의진화에